BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260423T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260423T203000
DTSTAMP:20260421T221346
CREATED:20260413T150959Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260413T150959Z
UID:16996-1776967200-1776976200@www.nlgja.org
SUMMARY:Chicago LGBTQ+ Journalists Mixer
DESCRIPTION:Meet\, mingle and build community with LGBTQ+ journalists\, allies and other media pros — tacos are on us! This event marks the start of NLGJA Chicago’s 2026 programming. Open to journalists\, student journalists\, PR and communications professionals\, media-adjacent professionals\, allies and more. Tacos and appetizers will be provided on a first come\, first served basis. A cash bar will be available. Bring a friend or colleague.
URL:https://www.nlgja.org/event/chicago-lgbtq-journalists-mixer-2/
LOCATION:Barcocina Lakeview\, 2901 N. Sheffield Ave.\, Chicago\, IL\, United States
CATEGORIES:Chapters
END:VEVENT
